<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <title>Frequently Asked Questions — FileVora</title>

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Find answers to frequently asked questions about FileVora tools, file processing, privacy and browser compatibility."
  >

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/tool-unified.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/filevora-header-tools.css">

  <style>
    .faq-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      max-width: 820px;
      margin: 34px auto 0;
      text-align: left;
    }

    .faq-item {
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid #dbe4ee;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: #ffffff;
      transition:
        border-color 0.2s ease,
        box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    }

    .faq-item[open] {
      border-color: #7dd3c7;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.07);
    }

    .faq-item summary {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 20px 22px;
      color: #0f172a;
      font-size: 17px;
      font-weight: 750;
      line-height: 1.4;
      cursor: pointer;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
      display: none;
    }

    .faq-item summary::after {
      content: "+";
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      color: #00a884;
      font-size: 25px;
      font-weight: 500;
      line-height: 1;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
    }

    .faq-item[open] summary::after {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    .faq-answer {
      padding: 0 22px 21px;
      color: #475569;
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .faq-answer p {
      margin: 0;
    }

    .faq-answer a {
      color: #009a73;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .faq-action {
      margin-top: 34px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .faq-item summary {
        padding: 17px;
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .faq-answer {
        padding: 0 17px 18px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <%- include("partials/tool-header") %>

  <main class="info-page">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="info-card">
        <div class="section-eyebrow">FILEVORA</div>

        <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

        <p class="info-lead">
          Quick answers about FileVora and our online tools.
        </p>

        <div class="faq-list">
          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>What is FileVora?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                FileVora is an all-in-one collection of online tools for
                working with images, PDF documents, text, developer data,
                calculations and other everyday file tasks.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Do I need to create an account?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                No. Most FileVora tools can be used without creating an
                account or signing in.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Are FileVora tools free to use?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                FileVora tools are currently available for general use without
                requiring a paid subscription. Usage limits or features may
                change as the service develops.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Are my files uploaded to a server?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                Many FileVora tools are designed to process files directly in
                your browser. Processing methods may differ between tools, so
                avoid using confidential or highly sensitive files unless you
                understand how the selected tool operates.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Does FileVora keep my files?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                FileVora does not intentionally retain files processed locally
                in your browser. Please read our
                <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a> for more information.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Which browsers are supported?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                FileVora is designed for modern versions of Chrome, Edge,
                Firefox and Safari. For the best experience, keep your browser
                updated and enable JavaScript.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Will the original quality always be preserved?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                Results depend on the tool, input file, selected settings and
                browser. Compression and format conversion may affect quality,
                so check important outputs before using or sharing them.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Should I keep a backup of my original file?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                Yes. Always keep a separate copy of important original files
                before converting, compressing or editing them with any online
                tool.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>Why is a tool not working?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                Check that the file type is supported, refresh the page and try
                again using an updated browser. Browser extensions, very large
                files or damaged input files may also affect some tools.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>

          <details class="faq-item">
            <summary>How can I report a problem?</summary>

            <div class="faq-answer">
              <p>
                Please describe the tool, file type and problem through our
                <a href="/contact">Contact page</a>. Do not send confidential
                files or sensitive personal information.
              </p>
            </div>
          </details>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-action">
          <a class="hero-button" href="/#tools">Explore tools →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="container footer-grid">
      <div class="footer-brand">
        <a class="brand" href="/">
          <span class="brand-mark">F</span>
          <span class="brand-name">File<span>Vora</span></span>
        </a>

        <p>Fast, simple online tools for everyday file tasks.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Company</h3>
        <a href="/about">About Us</a>
        <a href="/contact">Contact Us</a>
        <a href="/security">Security</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Resources</h3>
        <a href="/blog">Blog</a>
        <a href="/#tools">Tools</a>
        <a href="/faq">FAQ</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Legal</h3>
        <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>
        <a href="/terms">Terms of Service</a>
        <a href="/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a>
      </div>

      <div>
        <h3>Contact</h3>

        <a
          href="https://mail.google.com/mail/?view=cm&fs=1&to=filevora5%40gmail.com"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
        >
          Email
        </a>

        <a href="/contact">Facebook</a>
        <a href="/contact">Instagram</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container footer-bottom">
      <span>
        © <span data-current-year></span> FileVora. All rights reserved.
      </span>

      <span>All in One Tool.</span>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <script>
    document
      .querySelectorAll("[data-current-year]")
      .forEach((element) => {
        element.textContent = new Date().getFullYear();
      });
  </script>

  <script src="/js/filevora-tools.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/filevora-header-tools.js"></script>
</body>
</html>